  "details": "When you press the unfriend button on the web, it immediately removes the friend, so I accidentally unfriended someone important. Then I had to send them a friend request again.\n\nAlso, if you don't realize you accidentally unfriended someone, you might mistakenly think they unfriended you.\n\nSo please add a confirmation prompt asking if you really want to unfriend them when you press the unfriend button!!",
